('9904', '2376', 'cs_archive_description', 'Microlearning is a revolutionary learning solution that caters to the diminishing attention span of the average human. With short-form video entertainment and condensed copy scattered across the internet, knowledge consumers no longer have the time or will to sit through umpteen hours of boring, motionless training modules – either in person or online.

Microlearning breaks down complex content into smaller, easily-digestible chunks and delivers them to learners using visually entertaining graphics, engaging voiceover, and impressive animation.

Microlearning is the perfect method for learning leaders searching for a training solution for employees on rotating shift work, those with non-traditional positions, students with flexible schedules, and executives with highly-demanding jobs. Smaller sessions fit into everyone’s busy schedule AND boast dramatically higher retention and implementation rates in today’s digitally-focused world.'),
