<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">

Choosing the right delivery vehicle is as important as the content itself. For the Urban Heat Leadership Academy, Articulate Rise was the strategic choice. Read other<a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies/\"> case studies</a> where we utilized the perfect platform for the mission.

</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_16 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Responsive Advantage&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\">
<h3><b>The Responsive Advantage</b></h3>
</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">

Participants in disinvested neighborhoods often access training on mobile devices rather than high-end desktops. Articulate Rise provides a responsive, web-like experience that is “mobile-first,” ensuring that a resident waiting for a bus can engage with a 5-minute module just as easily as someone at a library computer.

</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Modern and Inclusive &lt;br \\/&gt;E-Learning For Nonprofits&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt; Digestible \\&quot;Micro-Learning\\&quot; Structure&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">
<h3><b>Digestible “Micro-Learning” Structure</b></h3>
</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">

We broke down the massive scope of environmental advocacy into easily digestible video lessons. This “Micro-Learning” approach respects the learner’s time and allows for immediate application of knowledge.

</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">
