('10191', '2416', 'solution', '<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_22 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;The \\&quot;Aftermath\\&quot; of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">
<h3><b>The “Aftermath” of Good Design: Measurable Socio-Economic Impact</b></h3>
</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_23 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">

The effectiveness of an instructional design firm isn’t measured by the beauty of the pixels, but by the movement of the needle.

</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_24 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;\\u00a01. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;1. Participant Confidence&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">
<h3> 1. Participant Confidence</h3>
</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_25 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">

The Nature Conservancy reported a significant increase in knowledge and confidence among the academy’s participants. These residents didn’t just learn about heat; they gained the tools to walk into a city council meeting and advocate for their neighborhood’s health.

</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_26 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. Professional Recognition&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">
<h3>2. Professional Recognition</h3>
</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_27 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">

The project exceeded expectations so thoroughly that it gained state-level recognition. Being a finalist for an Environmental Excellence Award in Arizona serves as a case study within a case study—proving that high-end eLearning is a viable tool for solving massive social crises.

</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-phone et_pb_bg_layout_light et_multi_view__hover_selector\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\" data-et-multi-view=\"{&quot;schema&quot;:{&quot;content&quot;:{&quot;desktop&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2 style=\\&quot;text-align: left;\\&quot;&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;Training Residents To Advocate &lt;br \\/&gt;For Their Local Environment&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;,&quot;phone&quot;:&quot;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Scalability&lt;\\/b&gt;&lt;\\/h2&gt;&quot;}},&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;et_pb_text&quot;}\" data-et-multi-view-load-tablet-hidden=\"true\" data-et-multi-view-load-phone-hidden=\"true\">
<h3>3. Scalability</h3>
</div>
</div>
<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_29 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\">
<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">

Because the solution was built with a “Bespoke” but modular mindset, The Nature Conservancy now has a digital asset that can be scaled to other heat-threatened cities with minimal friction.

</div>
</div>'),
