('10377', '2430', '_thumbnail_id', '2431'),
('10378', '2430', 'client_name', 'USA Swimming'),
('10379', '2430', '_client_name', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),
('10380', '2430', 'client_intro', '<p>USA Swimming is the national governing body for swimming in the United States, supporting athletes, coaches, and clubs with programs designed to enhance performance and knowledge. They are committed to ensuring certified coaches uphold the highest standards of education and training.</p>'),
('10381', '2430', '_client_intro', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),
('10382', '2430', 'client_logo', '2432'),
('10383', '2430', '_client_logo', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),
('10384', '2430', 'challenge_title', 'Online Training Challenges: Engaging eLearning for Coaches'),
('10385', '2430', '_challenge_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),
('10386', '2430', 'challenge', '<ul>
<li><strong>Credentialing at Scale:</strong> USA Swimming needed training that didn\'t just inform — it needed to formally certify coaches across a national network, requiring SCORM compliance and LMS integration with their Canvas platform.</li>
<li><strong>Replacing Outdated Formats:</strong> Legacy training relied on static documents and generic videos that failed to capture the nuance and athleticism central to competitive swimming coaching.</li>
<li><strong>SME Coordination:</strong> Expert coaches were geographically dispersed, making coordinated filming, script review, and approval cycles logistically complex.</li>
<li><strong>Brand Consistency:</strong> As USA Swimming\'s brand evolved over a multi-year engagement, all content needed to flex and update to reflect the current visual identity without requiring full reproductions.</li></ul>'),
('10387', '2430', '_challenge', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),
('10388', '2430', 'challenge_columns', '1'),
('10389', '2430', '_challenge_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),
('10390', '2430', 'solution_title', 'An Engaging eLearning Solution for USA Swimming'),
('10391', '2430', '_solution_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),
('10392', '2430', 'solution', '<p><strong>On-Site Collaborative Planning:</strong> The USA Swimming team traveled to Ninja Tropic\'s production facilities for immersive planning sessions — reviewing existing curriculum, aligning on brand standards, and co-developing the instructional design blueprint before a single frame was shot.</p>
<p><strong>Multi-Format Video Production:</strong> Each coaching module combined multiple production techniques: animation to visualize underwater biomechanics invisible to the poolside eye, B-roll footage of real athletes and drills, live-action hosts guiding the viewer through key concepts, and direct-to-camera interviews with recognized coaching authorities.</p>
<p><strong>SCORM-Compliant Interactivity:</strong> Ninja Tropic embedded quiz checkpoints, scenario-based decision questions, and completion tracking directly into each module — enabling the Canvas LMS to issue certifications upon successful completion.</p>
<p><strong>Ongoing Brand Adaptation:</strong> As USA Swimming refreshed their brand identity over the years, Ninja Tropic adapted templates, color systems, and lower-thirds across new and existing content to maintain a cohesive, professional presentation.</p>'),
('10393', '2430', '_solution', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),
('10394', '2430', 'solution_columns', '0'),
('10395', '2430', '_solution_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),
('10396', '2430', 'solution_image', '2433'),
('10397', '2430', '_solution_image', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),
('10398', '2430', 'solution_image_position', '0'),
('10399', '2430', '_solution_image_position', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),
('10400', '2430', 'results_title', 'The Result: Collaborative eLearning Design'),
('10401', '2430', '_results_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),
('10402', '2430', 'results', '<ul>
<li><strong>Hundreds of Certified Coaches:</strong> The microlearning library now supports the ongoing certification of coaches across the USA Swimming network, with bite-sized modules that fit into active training schedules.</li>
<li><strong>Exceptional Learner Feedback:</strong> Coaches consistently rated the content as \"engaging,\" \"easy to follow,\" and \"the best training we\'ve had\" — a direct reflection of the production quality and instructional design approach.</li>
<li><strong>LMS-Ready Certification Pipeline:</strong> The SCORM-compliant modules plugged seamlessly into Canvas, eliminating manual certification tracking and giving USA Swimming real-time visibility into coach progress.</li>
<li><strong>Multi-Year Partnership:</strong> The success of the initial engagement led to a long-term content relationship, with Ninja Tropic serving as USA Swimming\'s primary eLearning production partner across multiple coaching disciplines.</li></ul>'),
('10403', '2430', '_results', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),
