('10467', '2438', '_thumbnail_id', '2439'),
('10468', '2438', 'client_name', 'Zia Learning'),
('10469', '2438', '_client_name', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),
('10470', '2438', 'client_intro', '<p>Zia Learning is a pioneering agency in primary and secondary education known for delivering high-quality, customized learning experiences tailored to school districts across the country.</p>'),
('10471', '2438', '_client_intro', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),
('10472', '2438', 'client_logo', '2440'),
('10473', '2438', '_client_logo', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),
('10474', '2438', 'challenge_title', 'Revolutionizing Education with Video Learning'),
('10475', '2438', '_challenge_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),
('10476', '2438', 'challenge', '<p>The Cobb County School District needed to modernize its K–12 instructional materials at a scale most eLearning vendors couldn\'t accommodate. More than 300 videos were required — spanning live-action classroom content, animated explainers, and supporting curriculum documents — all within a compressed production window and constrained budget.</p>
<p>Zia Learning, a boutique instructional design agency, won the contract but needed a production partner capable of delivering at that volume without sacrificing quality. The additional complexity: all content needed to be delivered in both English and Spanish, requiring bilingual talent and parallel production pipelines.</p>'),
('10477', '2438', '_challenge', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),
('10478', '2438', 'challenge_columns', '0'),
('10479', '2438', '_challenge_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),
('10480', '2438', 'solution_title', 'Our Video Training Production Company\'s Special Process'),
('10481', '2438', '_solution_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),
('10482', '2438', 'solution', '<p>Ninja Tropic introduced a proprietary \"sandwich method\" — a hybrid AI-assisted production workflow where subject matter experts and curriculum writers established the instructional foundation, AI tools accelerated first-draft content creation, and human reviewers ensured clinical and pedagogical accuracy before final production.</p>
<p>A dedicated team of 30 professionals managed every production phase in parallel: scriptwriting, storyboarding, on-camera filming, bilingual talent casting, animation, and post-production. This allowed multiple videos to move through the pipeline simultaneously rather than sequentially, compressing overall delivery timelines without compromising individual quality standards.</p>'),
('10483', '2438', '_solution', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),
('10484', '2438', 'solution_columns', '0'),
('10485', '2438', '_solution_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),
('10486', '2438', 'solution_image', '2441'),
('10487', '2438', '_solution_image', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),
('10488', '2438', 'solution_image_position', '0'),
('10489', '2438', '_solution_image_position', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),
('10490', '2438', 'results_title', 'Impact and Outcomes: Setting a New Standard in eLearning'),
('10491', '2438', '_results_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),
('10492', '2438', 'results', '<p>All 300+ videos were delivered on schedule — a feat that distinguished Zia Learning sharply from competitors who typically offered generic webinar recordings or off-the-shelf content. The Cobb County School District received a complete, custom microlearning library in both English and Spanish, with production values that reflected the quality of their students\' education.</p>
<p>The project established Zia Learning\'s reputation as a premium instructional design partner for school districts, and validated the AI-assisted production model as a scalable approach for high-volume educational content. The rapid development system created for this engagement is now a core part of Zia Learning\'s production infrastructure.</p>'),
('10493', '2438', '_results', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),
('10494', '2438', 'results_columns', '0'),
('10495', '2438', '_results_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),
