('10513', '2442', 'client_name', 'Oceania Cruises'),
('10514', '2442', '_client_name', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),
('10515', '2442', 'client_intro', '<p>Oceania Cruises is a luxury cruise line known for exceptional service, exotic destinations, and unparalleled onboard experiences. They serve a predominantly 65+, wealthy, and highly educated demographic seeking enriching travel experiences.</p>'),
('10516', '2442', '_client_intro', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),
('10517', '2442', 'client_logo', '2444'),
('10518', '2442', '_client_logo', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),
('10519', '2442', 'challenge_title', 'Setting Sail on Digital Enrichment'),
('10520', '2442', '_challenge_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),
('10521', '2442', 'challenge', '<p>Oceania Cruises\' guest demographic — predominantly affluent, highly educated travelers aged 65 and older — expected enrichment experiences that matched the sophistication of their destinations. Digital literacy varied widely: some guests were tech-savvy content creators, others had never used a smartphone for photography. Standard eLearning approaches built for corporate audiences would not resonate.</p>
<p>The program also faced significant technical constraints: content had to function on 40 dedicated tablets running on each ship\'s closed local intranet, with no reliable internet connection at sea. The platform needed to support both self-directed learning and instructor-led classroom formats, while remaining simple enough for guests to navigate without assistance.</p>'),
('10522', '2442', '_challenge', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),
('10523', '2442', 'challenge_columns', '0'),
('10524', '2442', '_challenge_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),
('10525', '2442', 'solution_title', 'Crafting an Immersive Learning Journey'),
('10526', '2442', '_solution_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),
('10527', '2442', 'solution', '<p>Ninja Tropic developed a complete curriculum architecture spanning four subject areas — social media, travel photography, and videography — at four proficiency levels from introductory to advanced. Each of the 24 courses contained six lessons, yielding 200 hours of original instructional content built entirely within Articulate Storyline.</p>
<p>The production included original scripting, professional casting and filming of instructional segments, and the creation of simulated social media interfaces within the courseware — allowing guests to practice Instagram Stories, photo editing, and short-form video without leaving the course environment. The entire library was packaged for local intranet deployment with remote update capability, enabling content refreshes between voyages.</p>'),
('10528', '2442', '_solution', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),
('10529', '2442', 'solution_columns', '0'),
('10530', '2442', '_solution_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),
('10531', '2442', 'solution_image', '2445'),
('10532', '2442', '_solution_image', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),
('10533', '2442', 'solution_image_position', '0'),
('10534', '2442', '_solution_image_position', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),
('10535', '2442', 'results_title', 'Achieving Uncharted Success'),
('10536', '2442', '_results_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),
('10537', '2442', 'results', '<ul>
<li><strong>200 Hours of Premium Content:</strong> A complete, branded digital enrichment library that positioned Oceania Cruises as a destination for intellectual as well as physical exploration.</li>
<li><strong>Guest Experience Elevation:</strong> Post-voyage surveys reflected increased guest satisfaction with onboard programming, with the Digital Enrichment Academy cited as a standout amenity.</li>
<li><strong>User-Generated Marketing:</strong> Guests who completed photography and social media courses shared dramatically more content online, creating an organic marketing channel at no additional cost to Oceania.</li>
<li><strong>Scalable Cross-Fleet Deployment:</strong> The intranet-compatible format and remote update system allowed content to be refreshed and deployed across the entire fleet simultaneously.</li></ul>'),
('10538', '2442', '_results', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),
('10539', '2442', 'results_columns', '1'),
