('10684', '2459', '_wp_attachment_metadata', 'a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:690;s:6:\"height\";i:440;s:4:\"file\";s:28:\"2026/06/wonderful-1-1-1.webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:50015;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:28:\"wonderful-1-1-1-300x191.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:191;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:22936;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:28:\"wonderful-1-1-1-150x150.webp\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/webp\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:12655;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),
('10685', '2459', '_source_url', 'https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/wonderful-1-1-1.png'),
('10686', '2457', '_thumbnail_id', '2458'),
('10687', '2457', 'client_name', 'The Wonderful Company'),
('10688', '2457', '_client_name', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),
('10689', '2457', 'client_intro', '<p>The Wonderful Company is an organic food company well-known for their almonds and pistachios. With a diverse, multilingual workforce, they place a strong emphasis on safety in planting, harvesting, and product preparation.</p>'),
('10690', '2457', '_client_intro', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),
('10691', '2457', 'client_logo', ''),
('10692', '2457', '_client_logo', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),
('10693', '2457', 'challenge_title', 'The Problem'),
('10694', '2457', '_challenge_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),
('10695', '2457', 'challenge', '<p>The Wonderful Company operates large-scale agricultural operations with a diverse, predominantly Spanish-speaking workforce. Safety training needed to be fully bilingual — not translated as an afterthought, but designed from the ground up as a dual-language experience where Spanish-speaking employees felt equally prioritized, not accommodated.</p>
<p>The equipment used across Wonderful\'s operations — specialized harvesting machinery, packaging systems, storage infrastructure — is expensive, proprietary, and difficult to film safely under normal working conditions. Traditional training approaches would have required either on-site filming with live equipment (a safety risk in itself) or generic stock footage that bore no resemblance to the actual work environment.</p>'),
('10696', '2457', '_challenge', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),
('10697', '2457', 'challenge_columns', '0'),
('10698', '2457', '_challenge_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),
('10699', '2457', 'solution_title', 'Our Solution'),
('10700', '2457', '_solution_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),
('10701', '2457', 'solution', '<p>Ninja Tropic created a library of character-led animated videos where each character, scenario, and piece of equipment was illustrated specifically for Wonderful\'s operations. The 3D-style illustrations accurately depicted proprietary machinery without the cost or risk of live filming, giving employees a realistic visual reference for the equipment they operate daily.</p>
<p>The bilingual production strategy treated English and Spanish as equal primary languages — not a translation of one into the other. Voice talent, on-screen text, and subtitle timing were developed in parallel, ensuring that both language versions delivered the same instructional quality and cultural resonance.</p>'),
('10702', '2457', '_solution', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),
('10703', '2457', 'solution_columns', '0'),
('10704', '2457', '_solution_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),
('10705', '2457', 'solution_image', '2459'),
('10706', '2457', '_solution_image', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),
('10707', '2457', 'solution_image_position', '0'),
('10708', '2457', '_solution_image_position', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),
('10709', '2457', 'results_title', 'The Result'),
('10710', '2457', '_results_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),
('10711', '2457', 'results', '<ul>
<li><strong>6,000+ Employees Trained:</strong> The animated library reached Wonderful\'s entire operations workforce across multiple facilities in English and Spanish, establishing a consistent safety standard across the organization.</li>
<li><strong>Higher Completion Rates:</strong> The animated format and dual-language accessibility drove completion rates substantially above previous text-based training benchmarks.</li>
<li><strong>Reduced Equipment Risk:</strong> By providing visually accurate, equipment-specific safety guidance, the training reduced the gap between what employees learned in training and what they encountered on the job — a critical factor in preventing accidents.</li></ul>'),
('10712', '2457', '_results', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),
('10713', '2457', 'results_columns', '1'),
('10714', '2457', '_results_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_columns'),
