('10728', '2460', '_thumbnail_id', '2461'),
('10729', '2460', 'client_name', 'Oldcastle Infrastructure'),
('10730', '2460', '_client_name', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),
('10731', '2460', 'client_intro', '<p>Oldcastle Infrastructure is a leading building products company focused on improving operational processes across their production facilities. With complex manufacturing environments, effective employee training is critical to safety and performance.</p>'),
('10732', '2460', '_client_intro', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),
('10733', '2460', 'client_logo', ''),
('10734', '2460', '_client_logo', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),
('10735', '2460', 'challenge_title', 'Communicating Complex Processes Effectively'),
('10736', '2460', '_challenge_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),
('10737', '2460', 'challenge', '<p>Oldcastle Infrastructure needed to train production line employees on a newly implemented manufacturing process — but the complexity of the workflow made it nearly impossible to convey through conventional means. Slide decks couldn\'t capture the spatial relationships between machine components. Written instructions left too much room for misinterpretation. And scheduling a film crew for on-site recording would have disrupted active production operations and exposed sensitive proprietary processes.</p>
<p>The training also needed to be accessible on demand — not delivered in a single classroom session, but available for employees to review before, during, and after the process went live on the floor.</p>'),
('10738', '2460', '_challenge', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),
('10739', '2460', 'challenge_columns', '0'),
('10740', '2460', '_challenge_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),
('10741', '2460', 'solution_title', '3D Animated Training Video'),
('10742', '2460', '_solution_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),
('10743', '2460', 'solution', '<p>Ninja Tropic created a photorealistic 3D animated training video that reconstructed Oldcastle\'s production environment in digital space. Every piece of machinery, every workflow stage, and every safety checkpoint was modeled and animated to match the actual plant layout — giving employees a virtual walkthrough of the process before encountering it in person.</p>
<p>The 3D format offered capabilities impossible with live video: the camera could pass through machine housing to show internal mechanisms, operators could be shown from multiple simultaneous angles, and unsafe practices could be demonstrated and corrected without anyone actually performing them. The video was delivered as a standalone file accessible on floor tablets and break room screens.</p>'),
('10744', '2460', '_solution', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),
('10745', '2460', 'solution_columns', '0'),
('10746', '2460', '_solution_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),
('10747', '2460', 'solution_image', '2462'),
('10748', '2460', '_solution_image', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),
('10749', '2460', 'solution_image_position', '0'),
('10750', '2460', '_solution_image_position', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),
('10751', '2460', 'results_title', 'Successful Implementation and Expansion'),
('10752', '2460', '_results_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),
('10753', '2460', 'results', '<ul>
<li><strong>Process Adoption Accelerated:</strong> Employees who watched the 3D training demonstrated significantly faster uptake of the new process, with fewer procedural errors during the first weeks of implementation.</li>
<li><strong>Cost Avoidance:</strong> The 3D animation approach cost a fraction of what a live film production would have required — and delivered a more accurate, more flexible training asset that live footage couldn\'t have matched.</li>
<li><strong>Partnership Expansion:</strong> Oldcastle was so satisfied with the results that they commissioned additional 3D training videos for other processes, establishing Ninja Tropic as their go-to production partner for complex operational training.</li></ul>'),
('10754', '2460', '_results', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),
