('10909', '2473', 'challenge_title', 'The Problem'),
('10910', '2473', '_challenge_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),
('10911', '2473', 'challenge', '<p>Mentorship programs are one of the most consistently high-impact talent development investments organizations can make — but implementation rates remain low because HR teams and managers often don\'t know where to start. Engagedly had built mentorship functionality into their performance management platform, but needed content that would help customers understand the practice of mentorship before they could effectively use the tools.</p>
<p>The challenge was creating content sophisticated enough to earn the attention of senior HR professionals and people leaders, while remaining actionable enough to actually change how they ran their mentorship programs.</p>'),
('10912', '2473', '_challenge', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),
('10913', '2473', 'challenge_columns', '0'),
('10914', '2473', '_challenge_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),
('10915', '2473', 'solution_title', 'Our Solution'),
('10916', '2473', '_solution_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),
('10917', '2473', 'solution', '<p>The production process began with instructional design — working with Engagedly\'s subject matter experts to structure a mentorship curriculum that built progressively, from foundational principles to advanced implementation tactics. Ninja Tropic then produced a live-action filming day where expert hosts delivered the core curriculum content, which was subsequently enriched with animated overlays, motion graphics, and visual frameworks that transformed talking-head segments into visually engaging learning experiences.</p>
<p>Each video was designed to function both as standalone learning content and as a gateway into Engagedly\'s platform features — naturally bridging from conceptual understanding to practical application within the tool.</p>'),
('10918', '2473', '_solution', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),
('10919', '2473', 'solution_columns', '0'),
('10920', '2473', '_solution_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),
('10921', '2473', 'solution_image', '2476'),
('10922', '2473', '_solution_image', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),
('10923', '2473', 'solution_image_position', '0'),
('10924', '2473', '_solution_image_position', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),
('10925', '2473', 'results_title', 'The Result'),
('10926', '2473', '_results_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),
('10927', '2473', 'results', '<ul>
<li><strong>Subscriber Content Library:</strong> The completed video series became a premium content asset available to all Engagedly subscribers, increasing the platform\'s perceived value and reducing churn among accounts that engaged with the educational content.</li>
<li><strong>Thought Leadership Positioning:</strong> The high-production-quality series established Engagedly as a genuine authority on mentorship practice — not just a software vendor — a positioning that supported enterprise sales conversations.</li>
<li><strong>Program Adoption:</strong> Customers who consumed the training content demonstrated significantly higher rates of activating and sustaining mentorship programs within the Engagedly platform.</li></ul>'),
