('11195', '2497', '_source_url', 'https://www.ninjatropic.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/palaestra-1.webp'),
('11196', '2494', '_thumbnail_id', '2495'),
('11197', '2494', 'client_name', 'Mason City Clinic (MercyOne Hospital)'),
('11198', '2494', '_client_name', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_name'),
('11199', '2494', 'client_intro', '<p>Mason City Clinic recognized challenges with traditional patient education methods and developed a video-based program to improve patient experience and post-operative care compliance, setting a new standard in patient education for orthopedic care.</p>'),
('11200', '2494', '_client_intro', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_intro'),
('11201', '2494', 'client_logo', '2496'),
('11202', '2494', '_client_logo', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_client_logo'),
('11203', '2494', 'challenge_title', 'The Challenge: Inadequate Patient Education Methods'),
('11204', '2494', '_challenge_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_title'),
('11205', '2494', 'challenge', '<p>Post-operative recovery depends critically on patient adherence to discharge instructions — but the current model of delivering those instructions verbally during a rushed discharge appointment is fundamentally inadequate. Patients are often medicated, anxious, or overwhelmed when they receive their care instructions; family members who might retain the information aren\'t always present. The result is predictable: non-adherence, complications, and unnecessary return visits.</p>
<p>Mason City Clinic needed a scalable solution that could reach patients at the right moment — when they were home, calm, and ready to engage with their recovery plan — without requiring additional clinical staff time for every patient interaction.</p>'),
('11206', '2494', '_challenge', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge'),
('11207', '2494', 'challenge_columns', '0'),
('11208', '2494', '_challenge_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_challenge_columns'),
('11209', '2494', 'solution_title', 'The Solution: Video-Based Patient Education Program'),
('11210', '2494', '_solution_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_title'),
('11211', '2494', 'solution', '<p>The clinic developed a physician-prescribed video education system: rather than delivering a single standard post-operative video to every patient, surgeons could prescribe specific video modules based on each patient\'s procedure, recovery complexity, and individual risk factors. Patients received access to their personalized video library on their phone or tablet, organized sequentially to support their recovery timeline.</p>
<p>The platform included a simple accountability mechanism: clinicians could see which videos patients had watched and when, enabling targeted follow-up for patients who hadn\'t engaged with critical content. For elderly patients hesitant about technology, the interface was designed to require minimal navigation — video after video, no menus, no complexity.</p>'),
('11212', '2494', '_solution', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution'),
('11213', '2494', 'solution_columns', '0'),
('11214', '2494', '_solution_columns', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_columns'),
('11215', '2494', 'solution_image', '2497'),
('11216', '2494', '_solution_image', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image'),
('11217', '2494', 'solution_image_position', '0'),
('11218', '2494', '_solution_image_position', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_solution_image_position'),
('11219', '2494', 'results_title', 'The Results: Measurable Benefits for Patients and Providers'),
('11220', '2494', '_results_title', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results_title'),
('11221', '2494', 'results', '<ul>
<li><strong>100% Patient Approval Rate:</strong> Every patient surveyed reported that the video education program was effective — an extraordinary satisfaction benchmark for any patient-facing healthcare initiative.</li>
<li><strong>Reduced Complication Rates:</strong> Improved adherence to post-operative care instructions contributed to measurable reductions in complication rates and unnecessary return-visit frequency within the orthopedic department.</li>
<li><strong>Clinician Efficiency:</strong> The accountability tracking system allowed nurses to concentrate follow-up calls on patients who hadn\'t engaged with key content, rather than calling every patient indiscriminately — a significant time saving at scale.</li>
<li><strong>Cross-Department Adoption:</strong> The success in orthopedics prompted the GI department to implement the same system, with additional departments under evaluation — validating the model as a hospital-wide patient education standard rather than a departmental experiment.</li></ul>'),
('11222', '2494', '_results', 'field_ninjatheme_cs_results'),
('11223', '2494', 'results_columns', '1'),
