<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"container\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->
<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Animation, live action, graphic storytelling, and captivating narratives combine to revolutionize the eLearning corporate training industry – it’s just what we do. Check out some of our proud customers!</p>
