<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->
<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indiana University</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Illustrative Minimalist + Illustrative Animation</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Medical educators know it’s important to keep up with the times. That’s why it’s important to offer only the best learning resources for medical professionals. In fact, new educational methods, like elearning video animation, have the potential to increase student engagement and understanding. This is what made Dr. Mouhamad Yabrodi seek out NinjaTropic’s help. Dr. Yabrodi wanted to lead the charge for more innovative learning solutions in the medical field.<br></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Show more</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->
<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">San Diego Zoo</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>High Detail Illustrative + Character</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Loved by children and adults across the globe, the famous San Diego Zoo wanted to create live-action videos featuring their amazing staff scientists on the subject of plant propagation. A tough subject to film, the San Diego zoo reached out to Ninja Tropic experts to handle the job. Animating the staff and explanation, the eLearning modules featured the voice of the scientific explainer videos and were praised by all. The zoo even came back to Ninja Tropic for more!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

