s.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Dedicated Account Management</strong></td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td><td>Personalized service from an account manager who understands your needs.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Course Structuring Assistance</strong></td><td></td><td>Expert help with course structuring to create effective learning experiences.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Additional Instructional Design Support</strong></td><td></td><td>Additional support for enhancing your entire eLearning strategy.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
