<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Salary Comparison\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_6 inline-buttons et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_9 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_13 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nHiring a full-time LMS administrator can be costly. Salaries often range from $50,000 to $80,000 per year, depending on experience and location. You also need to factor in the cost of benefits, which can add 20-30% to the total cost.\\r\\n\\r\\nAdditionally, without proper training, LMS administration can quickly become a tedious and time-consuming task, diverting valuable resources away from creating engaging learning experiences and developing high-quality content. If you have a limited FTE budget, it’s crucial to prioritize investments that directly impact your learners.\\r\\n\\r\\nNinja Tropic’s LMS Admin Services offer a cost-effective solution with predictable monthly fees and no added personnel costs, allowing you to focus on what truly matters: delivering exceptional learning experiences.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_row et_pb_row_7 inline-buttons et_pb_equal_columns et_pb_gutters3\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_3_5 et_pb_column_10 et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1070,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"LMS Administrator Roles and Responsibilities\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"LMS administrators play a vital role in the success of your learning programs. They are responsible for:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eSystem Configuration:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Setting up and maintaining the LMS environment.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eUser Support:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Assisting learners and instructors with technical issues.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eContent Management:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Uploading and organizing courses, materials, and resources.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eData Analysis:\\u003c/strong\\u003e Tracking learner progress and identifying areas for improvement.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nHiring and training an in-house LMS administrator can be costly and time-consuming. Outsourcing this role to Ninja Tropic is a cost-effective and efficient solution.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1071,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:acf/video-block {\"name\":\"acf/video-block\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_69ac28bd57647\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_69ac290257648\",\"title\":\"Outsources LMS Management Services\",\"_title\":\"field_6976d60a207b6\",\"content\":\"Outsourcing your LMS management to Ninja Tropic is a smart investment in your organization’s learning and development initiatives. Here’s what you gain:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eA Dedicated Team\\u003c/strong\\u003e: A team of LMS experts focused solely on your success. This team becomes an extension of your own, providing personalized attention and support.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eProactive Support\\u003c/strong\\u003e: We don’t just react to problems; we actively monitor your LMS, identifying and resolving issues before they impact your learners. This ensures a smooth, uninterrupted learning experience.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003cstrong\\u003eCustom Solutions\\u003c/strong\\u003e: We understand that every organization is unique. That’s why we tailor our services to your specific needs and goals, ensuring your LMS works optimally for you.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\nDon’t let LMS management hold you back. Contact us today to learn more and get a personalized quote.\",\"_content\":\"field_6976d622207b7\",\"link\":\"\",\"_link\":\"field_6976d62a207b8\",\"video\":\"\",\"_video\":\"field_6976d638207b9\",\"thumbnail\":1074,\"_thumbnail\":\"field_697abd828e0bf\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

