<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Transform Your Training with [gradient]Custom eLearning Solutions[/gradient]\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"Ready to get your video training production off the ground but need a bit of help? We’ve got you. Talk to our experts about your project and see if we can help you focus on what you do best, and we’ll take care of the video-based educational training production. Go ahead and get the ball rolling by filling out the form!\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->', 'Competency Based Training', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'competency-based-training', '', '', '2026-06-29 02:21:31', '2026-06-29 02:21:31', '', '392', 'http://localhost:8080/?page_id=412', '0', 'page', '', '0'),
('414', '1', '2026-02-09 02:40:47', '2026-02-09 02:40:47', '<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSuccessful Sales Enablement Training Strategies That Work\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"When you need your sales team primed and ready to go with the latest and greatest information about your products, services, and organization – you turn to sales enabled training solutions but… are they working? Do you find your sales team off the phones more than on them trying to complete their sales enablement training plan?\\r\\nIt’s time to integrate a sales training strategy that actually works!\\r\\n\\r\\nWith microlearning strategies in a video-based sales enablement training platform, you can have your sales teams educated on the newest product information and back to doing what they do best in a fraction of the time – making money for the company.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1200,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"/elearning-video-animation-companies-free-consultation/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is Sales Enablement?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Sales enablement training gets your team ready and armed with crucial sales and soft skills to inform your current and potential clients with the most up-to-date information about your amazing products and services. Without it, your sales team will be challenged to close the sale and bring in crucial capital for your organization.\\r\\n\\r\\nIt can take the form of instructor-led classroom training, virtual training, or self-paced sales enablement training modules. With a video-based microlearning format, your sales learners will be engaged, entertained, and educated – and back to selling.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1205,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eWhy You Need a \\u003cem\\u003eSales Enablement \\u003c/em\\u003ePlan\\r\\n\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Your current sales team may be comprised of a few top performers and some who may need more time to learn the ropes. Effective sales enablement training gets those newbies and average-performers learning and implementing the new information quickly – improving their performance while limiting time away from their revenue-generating role.\\r\\n\\r\\nA great sales training strategy helps organizations crush their goals, achieve their mission, and drive a high-achieving sales culture among the team which is exactly what sales success looks like.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-group container ninja-box px-6 py-6 my-6\"><!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"container mt-4\"} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-columns container mt-4\"><!-- wp:column -->
<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Create a Training and Enablement Program Rooted in Performance</strong></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->
<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Well-rounded training and enablement programs not only teach your sales reps how to sell, but it also informs them of the sales process as a whole. When they understand where customers come from and where they’re headed after the sales conversation, they’ll better guide those clients through the buyer’s journey.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>With an effective sales enablement program, your team will feel supported and ready to take on anything that comes their way – a new product, new resources, and new customers.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}}} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>The Crucial Difference Between Sales Enablement &amp; Sales Training</strong></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->
<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Sure, you can teach your team the script and the rebuttals, but more than sales training is required. With a sales enablement strategy and program, sales training can transition into something much more valuable. Each training module builds upon the next, demonstrating how to use the knowledge and resources to their advantage.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Ditch the old “how-tos” of sales training and grow your learners into a sales enablement program.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column --></div>
<!-- /wp:columns --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"4rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:4rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOur Approach to Sales Enablement\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"An off-the-shelf or basic sales enablement training program isn’t going to cut it. We understand… and that’s why we develop bespoke or custom video-based sales enablement modules designed specifically for your organization and your team.\\r\\n\\r\\nIntegrating your brand, your distinct processes, and your one-of-a-kind structure, our approach to sales enablement is personal.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1215,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

