<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>How can <em>health education</em> videos and content help build stronger patient-provider partnerships?</strong></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->
<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->
<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">Health education videos bridge the communication gap between providers and patients. By simplifying medical jargon and visualizing concepts, these videos create a shared understanding. This helps patients make informed decisions about their health and strengthens the collaborative relationship with their healthcare team.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns -->
<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong>Creating Patient Education Materials – <em>Our Process</em></strong></strong></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->
<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>At Ninja Tropic, we take a personalized approach to video production. We work closely with you to understand your specific needs, target audience, and key messages. Our process involves:</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong>Consultation and Planning:</strong><br>We discuss your goals, identify your target audience, and develop a tailored <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/video-training-strategy/\">video strategy</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong> <strong>Scriptwriting and Storyboarding:</strong></strong><br> We craft clear, concise scripts and visualize the video flow with <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/elearning-consultants/\">storyboards</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong>Production:</strong><br>We handle all aspects of filming, <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/video-animation/\">animation</a>, and voiceover recording.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong>Editing and Post-Production:</strong><br>We refine the footage, add graphics and animations, and <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/custom-elearning-development/\">ensure the video aligns with your brand</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong>Delivery and Optimization:</strong><br>We provide the final video in various formats suitable for online sharing and in-office use.<br><br></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1262,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"800px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->
<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Patient-Education-Materials-Our-Process-980x1551-1-647x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1262\" style=\"width:auto;height:800px\"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:column --></div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eAward-Winning\\u003c/em\\u003e Patient Education Video Examples\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Check out our examples to see how we’ve helped other practices connect with patients through video.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://www.ninjatropic.com/project_category/patient-education/\\u0022\\u003eCheck out Patient Education Videos!\\u003c/a\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":1263,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"mesh\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-group mesh\"><!-- wp:columns -->
<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\"} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong><strong><strong>Types of <em>Patient Education</em> Videos</strong></strong></strong></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->
<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong>Instructional:</strong><br>Step-by-step videos are essential for patients to learn new skills and techniques. They can cover everything from self-care routines to medication management.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong><strong>Conceptual</strong></strong>:<br> Animated videos are great for breaking down complex medical information into easy-to-understand concepts. They can explain diseases, treatments, and preventative measures.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong>Expert-hosted:</strong><br>Featuring interviews with healthcare professionals, these videos provide valuable insights and expert advice. They can cover a wide range of topics, from the latest research to treatment options.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong>Procedure</strong><br>These videos help patients prepare for medical procedures by explaining what to expect. They can reduce anxiety and improve patient satisfaction.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>🔸 <strong>Delivery and Optimization:</strong><br>We provide the final video in various formats suitable for online sharing and in-office use.<br><br></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column -->
<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1269,\"width\":\"auto\",\"height\":\"800px\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\"} -->
<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Creative-Medical-Ed-and-Customized-509x1024.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1269\" style=\"width:auto;height:800px\"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:column --></div>
<!-- /wp:columns --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

