('433', '1', '2026-02-09 17:13:49', '2026-02-09 17:13:49', '<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eInteractive Technical Training\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Technical learning processes, step-by-step procedures, and complex undertakings that are integral to a company’s bottom line cannot be left to a boring, traditional slide deck. When effective training is crucial to employees being able to do their job well – it’s time to evolve in the way you educate them. Video-based eLearning aligns with employee preferences and attention to ensure each team member’s technical procedural mastery.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1376,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container\"} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-group container\"><!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Advantages of Technical Training</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Bullet points and still images don’t offer the 65% majority of visual learners a true demonstration of technical processes. Animated, visually-focused specialized training reaches employees faster and more effectively while seeing how the procedure is performed and applying that knowledge. When was the last time you were able to follow a complex set of process steps without seeing it done? Exactly.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Not to mention, operational cost savings are often associated with extensive on-the-job instruction. This is where a robust technical learning procedure comes into play.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022mt-4\\u0022\\u003eOur Approach\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Our Approach\\r\\nNot only does visual demonstration maximize effectiveness, but interactivity seals the deal. It’s not enough to learn a technical process, but the application of that process is key to achieving corporate and personal objectives – and that’s exactly what our visual-based eLearning provides.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

