<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center container\"><strong>Custom eLearning Solutions for<em> Content Monetization</em></strong></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"container\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-group container\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->
<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">If you’re looking to turn your learning content into a revenue stream, we can help. We design courses that not only educate but also provide opportunities for monetization through subscriptions, certifications, and more.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->
<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">We understand that content monetization is a complex process, and there are many different ways to approach it. That’s why we take the time to understand your specific goals and create a customized plan to help you achieve them.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->
<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Here are some of the ways we can help you monetize your eLearning content:</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->
<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>
<!-- /wp:separator --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"container\"} -->
<p class=\"container\">🔸 <strong>Subscriptions:</strong><br>We can help you create subscription-based courses that give learners access to a library of content for a recurring fee.<br><br>🔸 <strong>Certifications:</strong><br>We can help you develop certification programs that can be sold to learners who want to demonstrate their knowledge and skills.<br><br>🔸 <strong>Individual courses:</strong><br>We can help you create individual courses that can be sold as standalone products.<br><br>🔸 <strong>Corporate training:</strong><br>We can help you create corporate training programs that can be sold to businesses.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"container\"} -->
<p class=\"has-text-align-center container\">We have a deep understanding of the best practices for content monetization. We know what it takes to create high-quality courses that are in demand and that learners are willing to pay for. We also know how to market and promote your courses to reach the right audience.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Get a Quote!</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"6rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:6rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

