<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>* For quick reference: <em>WCAG 2.0 level AA r</em>equires a minimum contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for normal text and 3:1 for large text. <em>WCAG 2.1</em> requires a minimum contrast ratio of 3:1 for graphics and user interface components (for example, form input borders). WCAG Level AAA requires a minimum contrast ratio of 7:1 for normal text and 4.5:1 for large text.</p>
