('766', '1', '2026-03-07 16:35:49', '2026-03-07 16:35:49', '<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003ch1\\u003eInstructional Design Consulting \\u0026amp; eLearning Services Made Simple\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"If instructional design is not your forte, and you rack your brain to try to find a way to create innovative, engaging, and attention-grabbing eLearning designs – but keep coming up a bit short, it might be time to reach out to acquire instructional design consulting services.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith talented and experienced instructional design consultancy and eLearning services, you don’t have to worry about wasting time, effort, and capital on design, but can focus on business operations.\\r\\n\\r\\nFrom eLearning and video implementation to reporting to ensure KPIs are met (and exceeded), sometimes you just need a hand. Our talented instructional design consultants can help take your video-based or self-paced eLearning modules from “meh” to mesmerizing.\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":770,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Check out our work!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"gradient\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022pt-4\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003e\\u003cem\\u003eWhy should You Hire e-Learning Consultants?\\r\\n\\u003c/em\\u003e\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\\r\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003eYou’re at your wits end with where to begin your instructional design process.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003eYou’re frustrated with the eLearning design technology and you don’t have the time to learn an entirely new product.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003eYou’re pressed for time to get this new training out to learners.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003eYou need an instructional design consultant who specializes in everything – eLearning strategy and implementation from idea to evaluation.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\r\\n\\u0026nbsp;\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\",\"className\":\"py-4\"} /-->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat Does an \\u003cem\\u003eeLearning Consultant\\u003c/em\\u003e Do?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nTraining and learning are huge investments and when you get it wrong, you can turn your learners off to future instruction, not to mention throwing money directly into oncoming traffic. However, when set on the right path from defining your content and creating design to implementation and delivery, your training will surely hit the mark with our instructional design consulting services.\\r\\n\\r\\nWhen you work with one of our talented eLearning consultants, you can expect:\\r\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\r\\n \\t\\u003cli\\u003eA larger return on your investment\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cli\\u003eIncrease in learner success through proven instructional design strategies\\r\\n\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cli\\u003eTailored advice on design, implementation, and format to meet your unique needs\\r\\n\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRecommended vetted products and programs, as needed, with complete vendor management services\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAnd so much more…\\u003c/li\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\n\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":773,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"\\u003ch2\\u003eOur \\u003cem\\u003eInstructional Design\\u003c/em\\u003e Process\\r\\n\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nWithout a current analysis of what you’re working with, our talented eLearning consultants can’t offer you expert instructional design advice on the most effective path forward so that’s exactly where we’ll start.\\r\\n\\r\\nWe’ll consider proposed learner needs, corporate outcomes, KPIs, the best method of delivery for the content being taught, necessary services, accessibility, and evaluation strategies to ensure a positive ROI.\\r\\n\\r\\nWith Ninja Tropic consultants at the helm, your well-rounded and highly effective eLearning solutions are just within reach.\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":775,\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

