('2357', '5', '2026-05-28 05:33:33', '2026-05-28 05:33:33', '<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"\\u003ch1\\u003eMicrolearning Video Case Studies\\u003c/h1\\u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Microlearning is a revolutionary learning solution that caters to the diminishing attention span of the average human. With short-form video entertainment and condensed copy scattered across the internet, knowledge consumers no longer have the time or will to sit through umpteen hours of boring, motionless training modules – either in person or online.\\r\\n\\r\\nMicrolearning breaks down complex content into smaller, easily-digestible chunks and delivers them to learners using visually entertaining graphics, engaging voiceover, and impressive animation.\\r\\n\\r\\nMicrolearning is the perfect method for learning leaders searching for a training solution for employees on rotating shift work, those with non-traditional positions, students with flexible schedules, and executives with highly-demanding jobs. Smaller sessions fit into everyone’s busy schedule AND boast dramatically higher retention and implementation rates in today’s digitally-focused world.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1514,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"Hear from our happy customers\",\"url\":\"#\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":\"\",\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

