<li><strong>Engineering Professional Group</strong><strong><br /></strong> Launched a gamified onboarding experience with scenario-based learning, achieving a <strong>25% lift in first-year membership renewals</strong>.</li>
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
