<li>Do-It-Yourself ($2.95/month): Includes API integration, Artificial Intelligence aided translation, SSO, and many other features</li>
<li>Managed ($2.95-$5.95/month): Content produced by EdApp, additional account and onboarding support, comes with multiple plans</li>
<li>Enterprise (Custom): Dedicated account manager and onboarding support, <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/what-is-blended-learning/\">blended learning</a> plan, scalable production support<br /></li>
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->
<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">
<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.ispringsolutions.com/ispring-learn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iSpring Learn</a></strong></li>
</ol>
