<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We suggest going through the <a href=\"https://www.ispringsolutions.com/ispring-learn/pricing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pricing page</a> to get a clearer idea about it. But for 500 users, your pricing options are:</p>
