<li><strong><a href=\"https://axonify.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mLevel</a></strong></li>
</ol>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>mLevel is a data-driven digital learning platform that\'s used by some of the biggest companies in the world. As of March 2021, <a href=\"https://axonify.com/news/axonify-continues-to-scale-with-acquisition-of-digital-learning-platform-mlevel/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mLevel is a part of Axonify</a>, which is a leading frontline employee training platform.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
