</ol>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Surge9 is a \"mobile-first\" platform. Now mobile first can mean a lot of things, but for Surge9, it means that the app is written directly on iOS and Android OS. As a result, it can utilize the full capabilities of a smartphone giving you fast and responsive UI and, most importantly, offline access.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Apart from that, Surge9 is also powered by AI technology giving you access to advanced analytics, gamification, easy content authoring, multiple languages compatibility, and more.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">
<li>Easy content authoring features to create your own path to learning</li>
<li>AI-Powered microlearning</li>
<li>Fast and responsive UI even when you\'re offline</li>
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">
<li>Surge9 follows two different payment models. You can either get it on a per-user per year basis or per-user per month basis. But since it follows the SaaS model, you need to contact them to get an exact quote.</li>
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->
<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">
<li><strong><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/in/app/shotclasses/id1080943112\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ShotClasses</a></strong></li>
</ol>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>ShotClasses is a mobile-only platform, available for <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/in/app/shotclasses/id1080943112\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">iOS</a> and <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.mindtree.shotclasses&hl=en_IN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Android</a>, that lets you create microlessons using SCORM, videos, PDFs, presentations, and more, quickly and with minimal hassle.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Some noteworthy features include building quizzes, monitoring feedback, gamification, and peer-to-peer learning.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:list -->
