</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} -->
<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">
<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.talentcards.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TalentCards</a></strong></li>
</ol>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>While most of the microlearning software and solutions cater to a wide variety of employees, TalentCards focuses specifically on frontline or field workers. It\'s a mobile platform and uses a flashcard approach to learning.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Creating content is easy and can be done in three simple steps.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Firstly, create a card set with your selected material.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Add users and send an invite link to download the app.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Then share your card set with your employees so that they can access it on their smartphones.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">
<li>Easy content creation tool</li>
<li>Supports in-app branding and push notifications</li>
<li>A well-rounded freemium model</li>
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>TalentCards offers three different pricing models.</p>
