<li>Premium ($75/month up to 50 users): Everything in the free and standard model in addition to Automated notifications, activity log, teams, and a Success Manager.</li>
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>While there are many amazing microlearning platforms out there that let you create or learn content efficiently, not all of them are good for a corporate framework.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>In a corporate scenario, certain features, such as integration with HR systems, blended learning plans, and advanced analytics, become much more important.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you don\'t have a clear idea about the sort of learning environment you want to introduce in your corporate structure, talking to <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/contact-us/\">an eLearning solutions</a> team should help you figure out the best approach.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>With that said, two of the most popular platforms for corporate training today are 7taps and EdApp. There are other options out there, but these two are at the top of the ladder.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>People have shorter attention spans now. And in the corporate world, where picking up new skills is important for an employee, breaking down large chunks of knowledge into digestible bits can be extremely useful.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>These platforms let you utilize the power of digital learning and help your employees grasp different skills without sacrificing their responsibilities.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Hopefully, this article on the best platforms for corporate learning could help you find the perfect tool for your business.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>And of course, if you need <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/elearning-video-animation-companies-free-consultation/\">help with any of your learning needs</a>, we\'d be happy to help!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Make the Most of Microlearning Training</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Is a Microlearning Platform Essential to Deliver Training?</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>While a microlearning platform isn\'t absolutely essential to deliver training to your employees, it can make the overall process a lot smoother.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Many companies are opting to switch to a microlearning structure to help their workforce acquire skills quickly.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>What Is the Difference Between eLearning and Microlearning?</strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>eLearning platforms offer an online course in a structured \"long-form\" way, sort of what you would see in universities. That means <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-why-video-based-learning-is-a-must-for-corporate-elearning/\">eLearning</a> courses typically contain long videos, sometimes lasting 4 or 5 hours.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Microlearning, on the other hand, breaks down specific content into small units to make it easier for the learner to absorb and understand. Usually, a microlearning online course contains short videos, images, presentations, and other learning materials.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Is Microlearning Effective?</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes, microlearning is highly effective at delivering focused training to employees without getting in the way of complex workflows in a corporate environment.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Instead of going through long and tedious video lectures, microlearning takes a smarter approach by breaking it down into small pieces that are easier to understand.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a free 30-minute consultation with a Ninja Tropic expert to analyze your association, university, or enterprise’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.</p>
