<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Make the Most of Microlearning Training</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Is a Microlearning Platform Essential to Deliver Training?</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>While a microlearning platform isn\'t absolutely essential to deliver training to your employees, it can make the overall process a lot smoother.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Many companies are opting to switch to a microlearning structure to help their workforce acquire skills quickly.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong>What Is the Difference Between eLearning and Microlearning?</strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>eLearning platforms offer an online course in a structured \"long-form\" way, sort of what you would see in universities. That means <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/blog-why-video-based-learning-is-a-must-for-corporate-elearning/\">eLearning</a> courses typically contain long videos, sometimes lasting 4 or 5 hours.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Microlearning, on the other hand, breaks down specific content into small units to make it easier for the learner to absorb and understand. Usually, a microlearning online course contains short videos, images, presentations, and other learning materials.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Is Microlearning Effective?</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Yes, microlearning is highly effective at delivering focused training to employees without getting in the way of complex workflows in a corporate environment.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Instead of going through long and tedious video lectures, microlearning takes a smarter approach by breaking it down into small pieces that are easier to understand.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Are you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a free 30-minute consultation with a Ninja Tropic expert to analyze your association, university, or enterprise’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

