<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Bottom Line</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Training videos pay off in a big way for both employers and their employees. Beginning the process can be daunting: that\'s why we have provided our sample eLearning scripts to help you get started!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The sample eLearning scripts here follow traditional forms used in the eLearning industry. But do not feel that you must stick to one of these forms: your video can be a combination of these scripts or follow its own course if that better meets the needs of your audience.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you\'re feeling lost, consider hiring a professional writer––they can help guide you through crafting a script that meets your needs!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>After reading our sample training video script templates, do you need help choosing your style and format for your next training video? <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://ninjatropic.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">Contact Ninja Tropic</a>: we are here to help you get started on your next video! If you need some inspiration, check out some of our <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https://ninjatropic.com/elearning-video-portfolio\" target=\"_blank\">sample videos</a>!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

