<li>Expanded later to countries like Mongolia, Pakistan, Peru, the Philippines, Romania, Singapore, and Somalia</li>
<li>Reinforced their mission to bridge the gap between academia and the audit profession</li>
</ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>These are not just tech wins—they’re <strong>life-changing transformations</strong> fueled by continuing education.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2} -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion: The Time to Invest in Learning Is Now</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Continuing Education Platforms are no longer optional. They are mission-critical. They connect your members to growth, your association to revenue, and your field to the future.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The question isn’t if your association should adopt one. It’s how soon can you make it happen?</p>
