<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>A <a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/lms-management-services-the-challenge-of-filling-the-lms-role/\">Learning Management System (LMS)</a> is the <strong>technology backbone</strong> that delivers and tracks online learning. A continuing education platform often includes an LMS, but it also offers <strong>content strategy, certification tracking, analytics, and member engagement tools</strong> tailored to lifelong learning and association needs.</p>
