<p><a href=\"https://www.ninjatropic.com/case-studies-oldcastle/\">Oldcastle Infrastructure</a> needed to train employees on <strong>a new manufacturing process</strong>. Instead of relying on <strong>static PowerPoint slides</strong>, Ninja Tropic developed a <strong>3D animated training video</strong> that visually simulated each step of the procedure. Employees could <strong>pause, replay, and zoom in</strong>, allowing for <strong>better comprehension and skill adoption</strong>.</p>
