<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center container\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our <em>Case Studies<br></em></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->
<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">San Diego Zoo</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>High Detail Illustrative + Character</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Loved by children and adults across the globe, the famous San Diego Zoo wanted to create live-action videos featuring their amazing staff scientists on the subject of plant propagation. A tough subject to film, the San Diego Zoo reached out to the experts at Ninja Tropic to handle the job. Animating the staff and explanation, the eLearning modules featured the voice of the scientific explainer videos and were praised by all. The zoo even came back to Ninja Tropic for more!<br></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/case-studies/\">Show more</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->
<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Engagedly</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Infographic + Live Action</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Performance management is the forte of Engagedly, but when it came to implementing an eLearning solution that actually performed, they came to us. Engagedly needed a learning strategy for potential customers focused on mentorship and combining polished live action clips with beautiful animation was the perfect solution. At the end of the project, Engagedly had a collection of purposeful content for their subscribers to boost their corporate cultures through advisorship.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/case-studies/engagedly-mentorship-elearning/\">Show more</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"3rem\"} -->
<div style=\"height:3rem\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>
<!-- /wp:spacer -->

<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->
<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Old Castle</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>High detail Illustrative + 3D</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Procedural training is a challenging feat because traditional instructional methods struggle to keep attention. The experts at Oldcastle Infrastructure veered away from the ?normal slide deck? and opted for animated 3D training to visually demonstrate a new process to their line employees that they could access anytime. Oldcastle?s team connected instantly to the video and were able to implement the new complex process successfully.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/case-studies/oldcastle-3d-safety-training/\">Show more</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

