<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->
<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">When learners visualize themselves in relevant scenarios, scenario-based video eLearning enhances understanding and promotes effective implementation. It?s ideal for hands-on learners!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

