<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Balancing AI Efficiency with Clinical Accuracy</strong></h2>



<p><strong>Remember: Synthesia replaces the camera, not the doctor.</strong> AI platforms deliver scale but lack clinical expertise.</p>



<p>Never deploy an <strong>AI-generated medical training video</strong> without careful human review. SMEs must examine the script and final video to ensure accuracy. Mispronouncing pharmacological terms erodes training credibility. Synthesia supports phonetic spelling adjustments for flawless medical terminology.</p>



