<!-- wp:acf/hubspot-form {\"name\":\"acf/hubspot-form\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"Get a FREE Consultation With Ninja Tropic!\",\"_title\":\"field_697ad122e258a\",\"description\":\"\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_12  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18  et_pb_text_align_justified et_pb_text_align_center-tablet et_pb_bg_layout_light\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_text_inner\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n\\r\\nAre you aware of the sheer power of engaging eLearning solutions but not sure where to start? Schedule a \\u003cstrong\\u003efree 30-minute consultation\\u003c/strong\\u003e with a Ninja Tropic eLearning expert to analyze your organization’s content objectives and map out the interactive blueprint to achieve them.\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_13  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\\u0022\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"_description\":\"field_697ad133e258b\",\"form\":\"\\u003cscript charset=\\u0022utf-8\\u0022 type=\\u0022text/javascript\\u0022 src=\\u0022//js.hsforms.net/forms/embed/v2.js\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003cspan data-mce-type=\\u0022bookmark\\u0022 style=\\u0022display: inline-block; width: 0px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 0;\\u0022 class=\\u0022mce_SELRES_start\\u0022\\u003e﻿\\u003c/span\\u003e\\u003c/script\\u003e\\r\\n\\u003cscript\\u003e\\r\\n  hbspt.forms.create({\\r\\n    region: \\u0022na1\\u0022,\\r\\n    portalId: \\u00227816367\\u0022,\\r\\n    formId: \\u0022394c2aa7-ab2d-43b4-8cf2-d230dd4662bf\\u0022\\r\\n  });\\r\\n\\u003c/script\\u003e\",\"_form\":\"field_697ad143e258c\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->', 'LMS Implementation Consultant', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '381-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-06-25 21:04:23', '2026-06-25 21:04:23', '', '381', 'http://localhost:8080/?p=2872', '0', 'revision', '', '0'),
('2873', '0', '2026-06-25 21:37:08', '2026-06-25 21:37:08', '<!-- wp:acf/page-heading {\"name\":\"acf/page-heading\",\"data\":{\"title\":\"u003ch1u003eTraining SimulationrnSoftware for eLearningrnu003c/h1u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_699a0f54e75a3\",\"description\":\"Tech, software, and systems are a staple in every company, in every industry, and without them, consumers don’t quite get the service they’re used to – and we all know that customer satisfaction is what keeps them coming back and what grows that bottom line.rnrnGetting all your team members on the same page with systems, software, and processes can seem like a challenging, daunting task – especially with varying starting levels of technical ability. This leaves learning leaders scrambling on how to instruct everyone in the new system effectively to keep operations running smoothly.rnrnThey must be able to get into the software and practice with it in order to become comfortable using the live production system but gathering employees locally, statewide, nationally, or even globally for an in-person instructional session may not be the right move for your organization.rnCue virtual training simulation software. Beneficial in so many ways, training simulation software is the answer to all the woes of systems training – giving learners a way to get hands-on experience before the actual launch, and the sought-after flexibility of an eLearning format.\",\"_description\":\"field_699a0f65e75a4\",\"image\":1465,\"_image\":\"field_699a0f73e75a5\",\"link_1\":{\"title\":\"See Our Solutions\",\"url\":\"/corporate-training/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_1\":\"field_699a0f7ee75a6\",\"link_2\":{\"title\":\"Get a Quote!\",\"url\":\"/elearning-video-animation-companies-free-consultation/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"_link_2\":\"field_699a0f96e75a7\",\"right_to_left\":\"0\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a0f9de75a8\",\"design\":\"simple\",\"_design\":\"field_699a0fefe75a9\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

<!-- wp:acf/section-2-rows {\"name\":\"acf/section-2-rows\",\"data\":{\"right_to_left\":\"1\",\"_right_to_left\":\"field_699a2bc7383f5\",\"design\":\"mesh\",\"_design\":\"field_699a2be0383f6\",\"title\":\"u003ch2 class=u0022mt-6u0022u003eWhat is Educational Simulation Software?u003c/h2u003e\",\"_title\":\"field_69765f2c461c3\",\"description\":\"Taking a real-to-life software simulation and embedding it into training offers learners the experience of a practical approach without risk to the company. Making mistakes and finding success in a simulation-type environment offers a unique learning experience unmatched by traditional training methodology.rnrnWith such impeccable positive learning statistics measured with educational simulation software as a training technique, it’s a win-win for both the organization and its team members.\",\"_description\":\"field_69765f79461c4\",\"image\":\"\",\"_image\":\"field_699a2d9482a32\"},\"mode\":\"preview\"} /-->

