<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"66.66%\"} -->
<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1} -->
<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Minimalist-Abstract</h1>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:separator {\"className\":\"is-style-dots\",\"backgroundColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->
<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-text-color has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-alpha-channel-opacity has-luminous-vivid-orange-background-color has-background is-style-dots\"/>
<!-- /wp:separator -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Is a design style that is characterized by its simplicity and use of basic shapes and limited color palettes. It is an effective style for eLearning as it conveys complex information in a clear and concise manner. Minimalist-Abstract can be used to create a minimalist and modern look that is visually appealing and easy to understand. In instructional design, the use of Minimalist-Abstract can help to make learning more efficient and effective by focusing on the most important information and concepts.<br></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

