<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center container\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->
<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indiana University<br><strong><small><strong><small>Motion Comics</small></strong><br></small></strong></h5>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Medical students grapple with complex health sciences. Dr. Mouhamad Yabrodi from Indiana University sought an innovative solution.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Our interactive ICU simulation game brought the subject to life.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Learn how this life-saving learning experience was created.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:buttons -->
<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Read more!</a></div>
